  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb — follows standard -AR endings with no exceptions",
    "Past participle: *alejado* (regular)",
    "Means \"to move (something) away\" or \"to distance\" — *aleja la silla de la mesa* (move the chair away from the table), *eso lo aleja de sus objetivos* (that distances him from his goals)",
    "Reflexive *alejarse* is very common for \"to move away/go away (oneself)\": *se alejó sin decir nada* (he/she walked away without saying anything)",
    "Related: *lejos* (far, the root adjective/adverb), *alejado/a* (distant, remote), *alejamiento* (distancing, estrangement)"
  ],
